  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The members of the Union of Associative and Community Radios (Union des Radios Associatives et Communautaires) are dedicated to the progress, education, and empowerment of populations by promoting good governance and local democracy. The union aims to work on its overall goal of strengthening legal, economic, and governance frameworks favorable to the development of community media and citizen participation. As with all Hewlett media grants, this grant maintains editorial independence.</narrative>
